### Crear un usuario
POST http://localhost:3001/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mluukkai@iki.fi", "name": "Matti Luukkainen" }

### Login (los usuarios creados sin contraseña entran con "secret")
POST http://localhost:3001/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mluukkai@iki.fi", "password": "secret" }

### Crear un blog (pega el token del login)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{ "author": "Dan Abramov", "url": "https://overreacted.io/on-let-vs-const/", "title": "On let vs const", "year": 2019 }

### Buscar blogs
GET http://localhost:3001/api/blogs?search=react

### Autores
GET http://localhost:3001/api/authors

### Añadir a la lista de lectura
POST http://localhost:3001/api/readinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{ "blogId": 1, "userId": 1 }

### Lista de lectura de un usuario (solo los no leídos)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/users/1?read=false

### Marcar como leído
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/readinglists/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{ "read": true }

### Cerrar sesión
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/logout
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
